  "retained_premises": [
    "Original coefficient DVR, frame and F.Ok(C0), normalized rank-three Space and supplied Loc, its residue embedding, same marked representation and all ordered ordinary character conditions.",
    "E_A contained in x for the parity presentation. Noncontainment of the below-diagonal ideal T_+ at x for positivity and the triangular dimensions. The final sharp3 has the original F.Big(C0) and T_+ condition.",
    "The complete-local dimension and connectedness input of ACC1–3 and original frame Euler and strict cohomology inputs remain in scope.",
    "Rank-two FinLam and AllGood, separate rank-three corner ideal, global preconnectedness, seed existence, automorphic inputs and full propagation are outside these conclusions."
  ],
